Third-party icons in Surfn

These files are byte-identical to a file of another icon theme (found by comparing contents), or carry the
export path of Paper's author. They keep their original licence. Icons that were recoloured or edited
no longer match and are not listed, so this is a minimum.

Numix: 1036 files, GPL-3.0, https://github.com/numixproject
Breeze: 650 files, LGPL-3.0-or-later, https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/breeze-icons
Papirus: 523 files, GPL-3.0, https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme
Paper: 205 files, CC BY-SA 4.0, https://github.com/snwh/paper-icon-theme
elementary: 1 file, GPL-3.0, https://github.com/elementary/icons

2415 files in total under usr/share/icons/Surfn/

